1
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:07,180
(Sheldon:)Three thousand hours.

2
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:10,310
(Sheldon:)Three thousand hours
clicking on that mouse,

3
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:12,280
(Sheldon:)collecting weapons and gold.

4
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:17,150
(Sheldon:)It's almost as if it was
a huge waste of time.

5
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:18,790
(Howard:)Whoever did this
knew what they were doing.

6
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:20,820
(Howard:)He got in and out
of your account in under

7
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,320
(Howard:)15 minutes, transferred
all your stuff,

8
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:24,560
(Howard:)and didn't leave
a digital fingerprint.

9
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,790
(Sheldon:)Oh!

10
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,360
(Sheldon:)There isn't enough
chamomile tea in the world

11
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:31,270
(Sheldon:)to quell the rage in my heart.

12
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,970
(Raj:)Hold on. I'm talking to an orc

13
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:35,540
(Raj:)under the bridge
in Thunder Bluff

14
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:38,370
(Raj:)who says if we pay him, he'll
help us track down your things.

15
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,870
(Sheldon:)Can we trust him?

16
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,180
I should say so;
he appears to be a member

17
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:44,710
(Raj:)of the Nigerian royal family.

18
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:49,580
(Howard:)Whoa! Somebody's auctioning off
a jeweled ostrich bridle!

19
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:51,220
(Sheldon:)No. Glenn's was leather.

20
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:54,260
(Sheldon:)He was a simple ostrich.

21
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:57,260
(Sheldon:)Is! Is, I haven't given up hope.

22
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:00,030
(Sheldon:)Hey.

23
00:01:00,030 --> 00:01:02,260
(Leonard:)Hey, Penny. We're kind of in
the middle of a crisis, here.

